## Local secrets
# appsettings.Local.json holds the platform-support password and anything
# else that must not be committed. Program.cs loads it last, so it overrides
# appsettings.json. Never track it: the EnterpriseAdmin credential can reset
# any clinic admin's password across the whole platform, and a secret pushed
# to git history stays there whatever gets deleted afterwards.
appsettings.Local.json

# The server's own copy, written on the machine and never in the repo. The
# .template beside it is committed; this filled-in version is not.
appsettings.Production.json

